  "使用当前选择的股票，不替换为其他标的。": "Uses the selected stock without substituting another symbol.",
  "采用已有自选股中当前市场的首只股票，尊重你的关注顺序。": "Uses the first watchlist stock in this market, preserving your watchlist order.",
  "当前市场没有已配置的自选股，采用固定演示标的以便复现试用；这不是实时优选或投资推荐。": "No watchlist stock is configured for this market. A fixed demonstration stock makes the trial reproducible; it is not a live selection or investment recommendation.",
  "科创板/创业板优先使用成长质量方法，审查增长、现金流与估值反例；其他股票采用综合研究。板块只是研究起点，不代表成长性已获验证。": "STAR Market and ChiNext stocks prioritize growth-quality research, including cash flow and valuation counter-evidence. Other stocks use comprehensive research. Board membership does not establish growth quality.",
  "成长质量配置或 Skill 不可用，已明确回退到综合研究。": "Growth-quality configuration or Skill is unavailable. This plan uses comprehensive research instead.",
  "优先采用均衡多因子规则，兼顾质量、估值、趋势与风险；数量使用正式版本配置，默认不追加逐股深研以控制成本。": "Prioritizes balanced factors across quality, valuation, trend, and risk. Candidate count follows the published strategy; further stock research is off by default to limit cost.",
  "单只明确标的、日级趋势与回踩研究，10% 仓位上限和人工确认；只生成模拟提案，不下单或承诺收益。": "One stock, daily trend and pullback research, a 10% position limit, and human confirmation. Generates paper proposals only, with no orders or return guarantees.",
  "按标的研究特点匹配具体专家，独立审查假设与风险，保留分歧。": "Matches experts to the research subject to independently review assumptions and risks while retaining disagreements.",
  "匹配的专家不可用或被停用，本次仅由主 Agent 解读，不自动启用专家。": "Matched experts are unavailable or disabled. Only the main Agent provides commentary; experts are not enabled automatically.",
  "工具与数据源只取当前已启用的任务默认白名单；不自动挂载额外 MCP 或新增权限。": "Uses only enabled default tools and data sources. No additional MCP connections or permissions are added automatically.",
  "将调用真实数据与模型，专家评审会增加调用成本。数据或模型不可用时会明确报错，不保证必然产出报告；默认方案不是收益最优或投资推荐。": "Uses real data and model calls. Expert review adds cost. Unavailable data or models produce explicit errors, so a report is not guaranteed. This plan is not an optimized-return recommendation.",
  "当前市场没有可用的默认正式策略，请在策略中心检查已发布配置，或切换市场。": "No default published strategy is available for this market. Check published configurations or switch markets.",
  "沃伦·巴菲特": "Warren Buffett", "查理·芒格": "Charlie Munger", "段永平": "Duan Yongping", "凯西·伍德": "Cathie Wood", "张磊": "Zhang Lei",
  "从企业所有者视角判断商业质量、护城河、资本配置和买入价格。": "Evaluate business quality, moats, capital allocation, and entry price from an owner's perspective.",
  "用跨学科心智模型、激励机制和反向思考识别认知偏差与致命风险。": "Use multidisciplinary models, incentives, and inversion to identify cognitive biases and critical risks.",
  "优先判断生意模式、消费者价值和企业文化，只研究真正看得懂的公司。": "Prioritize business models, customer value, and company culture within a clear circle of competence.",
  "关注技术曲线、成本下降、平台融合和长期渗透率，同时显式处理高估值风险。": "Study technology curves, falling costs, platform convergence, and long-term adoption while explicitly examining valuation risk.",
  "研究长期结构变化、企业家能力和价值创造空间。": "Research structural change, entrepreneurial ability, and long-term value creation.",
  "底部放量": "Bottom volume expansion", "箱体震荡": "Range trading", "默认多头趋势": "Bull trend", "缠论": "Chan theory", "龙头策略": "Sector leaders", "情绪周期": "Sentiment cycle", "事件驱动": "Event driven", "预期重估": "Expectation repricing", "成长质量": "Growth quality", "热点题材": "Market themes", "均线金叉": "Moving average golden cross", "一阳夹三阴": "One bullish / three bearish candles", "缩量回踩": "Low-volume pullback", "放量突破": "Volume breakout", "波浪理论": "Elliott wave theory",
  "检测长期下跌后底部放量信号，潜在趋势反转信号。": "Detect volume expansion after a prolonged decline as a potential reversal signal.",
  "识别价格箱体区间，在箱底买入、箱顶减仓，适用于横盘震荡行情。": "Identify trading ranges and assess entries near support and reductions near resistance.",
  "默认个股分析优先策略，识别多头排列、趋势延续与回踩低吸机会。": "Default stock research method for bullish alignment, trend continuation, and pullback entries.",
  "基于缠论笔、线段、中枢结构，判断趋势级别、买卖点与背驰信号。": "Use Chan theory strokes, segments, and central zones to assess trend levels, entry/exit points, and divergence.",
  "板块轮动中识别龙头股。适用于板块启动或行业催化剂出现时。": "Identify sector leaders during rotation, emerging sector trends, and industry catalysts.",
  "基于市场情绪、换手率与量价结构，识别情绪低点（恐慌底）与情绪高点（狂热顶），逆情绪布局。": "Use sentiment, turnover, price, and volume to identify panic lows and euphoric highs for contrarian research.",
  "围绕业绩、政策、并购、订单、产品发布等事件，评估催化强度、兑现概率和风险边界。": "Evaluate catalysts, realization likelihood, and risk limits around earnings, policy, acquisitions, orders, and product launches.",
  "分析业绩预期、政策预期和估值预期的变化，寻找预期差修复或预期过热后的回落风险。": "Study earnings, policy, and valuation expectations for repricing opportunities and excessive-expectation risks.",
  "结合收入利润增长、ROE、现金流和行业空间，识别高质量成长股与成长失速风险。": "Assess revenue and earnings growth, ROE, cash flow, and industry potential to examine growth quality and slowdown risks.",
  "跟踪政策、产业和市场热点，判断题材强度、板块扩散和个股相对强弱。": "Track policy, industry, and market themes to assess strength, sector diffusion, and stock relative performance.",
  "检测均线金叉配合量能确认信号，经典的趋势反转/延续信号。": "Detect moving average golden crosses with volume confirmation for trend reversal or continuation.",
  "检测一阳夹三阴K线整理形态，趋势延续入场信号。": "Detect the one-bullish/three-bearish consolidation pattern as a potential trend-continuation entry.",
  "检测缩量回踩均线支撑信号，趋势延续的理想入场点。": "Detect low-volume pullbacks to moving average support for possible continuation entries.",
  "检测放量突破阻力位信号。适用于股价接近已知阻力位时。": "Detect volume-confirmed breakouts near known resistance.",
  "基于艾略特波浪理论的推动浪与调整浪结构，判断当前所处浪型与潜在目标价。": "Use Elliott impulse and corrective waves to assess the current wave structure and potential price targets.",
